  "translation": "Na ol sevetman bilong en i tokim em: Lukim, mipela i harim olsem ol king bilong haus bilong Yisrael, olsem king bilong khesed ol i stap. Mipela putim, plis, saka long bel bilong mipela na ol rop long hed bilong mipela, na mipela i go ausait i go long king bilong Yisrael; sapos em i ken kirapim ⟨את⟩ laip bilong yu.",
